oin our Discord! ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T14:09:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929842","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3656500-1840944183786313","game_id":"steam-3656500","kind":"announcement","title":"The Open Playtest Is Live!","summary":"Jaden Industries Open Playtest is now live!Engineers, attention! Jump in, play the game, try things, break things, and let us know what you think. 🏭 Build and automate production lines across floating islands⚙️ Solve factory puzzles your own way🔬 Progress through the game and unlock new possibilities💥 Break things we somehow managed not to break ourselvesRun into a bug? Have an idea? Want to tell us what you think?💬Join our Discord! 💬","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T15:04:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786313","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3656500-1818118366185235","game_id":"steam-3656500","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest Has Started!","summary":"Welcome to the Closed Playtest!The first wave of players has just received access - thanks to everyone who joined in! We’ll keep sending out more invites over the next few days, so stay tuned if you haven’t been picked yet!If you have feedback, questions, or want to share your playthroughs, we’d love to hear from you in our Discord. Your impressions help us improve the game as we continue development!Join our Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-09T12:37:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366185235","verified_at":"2026-10-